Design alignment (not shipped as third-party source)
----------------------------------------------------

Component naming and token semantics align with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS
v4 conventions. Jadix reimplements these APIs in Rust; upstream React/TS source
is not vendored into this repository.

Window glass recipes (Blur / Aero / Acrylic / Mica graphs, tint opacity
modifier, Aero inactive remaps) follow publicly documented WinUI Acrylic
behavior and the effect-graph structure described by DWMBlurGlass
(LGPL-3.0, https://github.com/Maplespe/DWMBlurGlass). Jadix does not vendor
that project's source, assets, or DWM injection.

Local reference snapshots under `Reference/` (when present on a developer
machine) are for comparison only and are not included in published crates.

System clipboard is `jadix_clipboard` (workspace crate; fork of clipboard-rs
0.3.x, MIT, ChurchTao). See `crates/jadix_clipboard/NOTICE`.

